EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hi,

Please note the following New Account has been created. 

IMPORTANT: Please verify whether Customer Code exists. If it already exists, please do not create a new account, instead please update the account details as per below.

Customer code in iCargo (IATA code): {!Account.IATA_Number__c}

Agent/Customer Name: {!Account.Name}

Global Customer Code (iCargo & Taurus only) (FCI): {!Account.Freight_Corporate_Identifier__c}

Address: {!Account.BillingAddress}

Approver: {!Account.Freight_Clearance__c}

Customer Type (Scorpio only): {!Account.Freight_Agent_Type__c}

Origin: {!Account.Freight_Station_Code__c}

Billing Calendar: {!Account.Freight_Billing_Calendar__c}

Billing Period: 30 days

Currency: {!Account.CurrencyIsoCode}

Contact Details: {!Contact.Name}

Phone: {!Contact.Phone}

Fax: {!Contact.Fax}

Email: {!Contact.Email}

Customer Number (Taurus) (Cust#): {!Account.Freight_eQ_Reference__c}

Address Number (Taurus) (Ref#): {!Account.Freight_Reference__c}

Thanks,

{!Account.OwnerFullName}

{!Account.OwnerEmail}
